	{
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=1, time=1500},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat030170"},
		line=771,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"The day of the uprising, 1800 hours─",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Security seems rather tighter than usual today. Might you have some reason to be so concerned?”",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I was thinking of conducting some training exercises to prepare for any emergencies.”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“It would be best for you to stay in the Imperial Palace this evening and focus your attention on your own duties.”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“I see, I see. An unfortunate training accident would be a terrible thing indeed.”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"Is he insinuating that I might kill him off and make it seem like an accident?",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"Well, he's not far off.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You'd do well to not think so little of me. My personal unit would never do anything by accident.”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“I do beg your pardon.”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Why, the older you get to be, the more anxious you grow about the younger generations.”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Worry about yourself instead.”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Hahaha, that is surely the case.”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Well then, I'll be off to see to my duties.”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“It is all well and good that you would see to my protection, but you ought to watch yourself as well.”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“As the future governor-general, your personal safety is of paramount importance.”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"Okonogi turns and slowly shuffles away.",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"He's nothing but a pathetic old man consumed by avarice. I\nshouldn't let him get to me.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"I know this, but a shiver still runs down my spine all the same.",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"It feels just like I've unwittingly boarded a sinking ship.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"I give my cheeks a firm clap and turn to look at my unit.",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"I've briefed each and every one of them on the full details of Operation Bellflower.",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"Beginning at 1900 hours, less than an hour from now, the warriors will stage their uprising from their headquarters in Yogarasu District.",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"We will refrain from engaging them as they storm the Imperial Palace and neutralize Okonogi.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"Only then will we make our move.",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"While their guard is down, we will encircle them within the palace and eliminate them.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			{
"Okonogi's personal Forbidden Guard is away for training on a remote island.",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			{
"The Republican forces that aren't in on the operation are forbidden to act without orders from the acting governor-general.",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"There's nothing that can stand in my way.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			{
"I will finally be able to round up every last one of the warriors.",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"But the issue still remains...",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"Once Okonogi and the warriors are out of the picture, what am I to do with Empress Hisui?",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			{
"I'd always thought her just a meek little girl, but she's displayed a terrifying tenacity when it comes to Tokita-kun.",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"She will never forgive me for betraying the warriors.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"It's all but given that she'll do everything she can to obstruct my plans for the Empire.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"I don't hate her by any means, but if push comes to shove...",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			{
"The ringing of my phone interrupts my thoughts.",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"It's a call on the most secure line.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Who is it?”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Warren Valentine.”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Governor-General...”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Do you have some urgent business with me?”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"He's never been the type of man who would call just to check up on his daughter.",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“In ten minutes, we will commence our bombing of Yogarasu District.”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Bombing?”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"It's been three entire days since the governor-general sailed away for the mainland.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"His carrier should be well out of striking range of Tenkyo.",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Are you still within the Empire?”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Naturally.”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"My father never returned to the mainland after all.",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Why was I not informed of this?!”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“I wanted to see how you'd react.”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"I grit my teeth.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"He tricked me.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“I ordered Rochel to carry out the bombing order, but it looks like you've ignored it.”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“There are countless civilians living in Yogarasu District!”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Take care of the cleanup.”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Show me what you can do as acting governor-general.”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I am heading for Yogarasu District right now.”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Will you still not rescind the bombing order?”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“Hmph...”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Warren"},
			{
"“It seems the warriors have taught you well.”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"The call ends.",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"Even his own daughter's life isn't enough.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"So that's the way it is... I see...",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"I grit my teeth until they let out a terrible grinding sound.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"It's already too late to recall the bombers.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"T-minus eight minutes...",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"If I do nothing, the warriors, not to mention thousands of civilians, will all be killed.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			{
"What can I do? What ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"should",
{"/font"},
" I do?",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			{
"Standing there in a daze, I hear the sound of my phone making a call.",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"Without even realizing it, I've placed a call to Tokita-kun.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			{
"...What am I even doing?",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"I quickly hang up and bite down hard on my lip.",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"Calm down.",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			{
"I shouldn't have any need for hesitation.",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"I've finally found an object worthy of my fealty.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"All I have to do is decide how best to fulfill it.",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"That's right─",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"Even if it means losing everything I've built up thus far...",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"Even if it means betraying my country...",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"I ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"will",
{"/font"},
" protect the last and final modicum of virtue left within me.",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"─I have nothing to fear.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"I reach towards the row of medals at my lapel.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"─There are plenty of people like Shino who live their lives unfettered by national allegiances.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			{
"I tear them out with a satisfying ease.",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			{
"They clatter to the ground with a much lighter sound than I was expecting.",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"─I have nothing more to lose.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“All troops, atten-tiooooon!”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"I shout at the top of my lungs.",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“The governor-general has ordered an aerial bombing of Yogarasu District set to commence imminently!”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“If we refuse to take action, thousands of civilians are sure to perish in flames!”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"A wave of agitation ripples through my subordinates.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“We set foot on this land to liberate the people of the Empire from tyranny.”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“It is unforgivable for us to then tyrannize the Imperial people with our own violence!”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You are welcome to mock these as platitudes! Curse and jeer all you wish!”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“But no matter how I am mocked, that will not sway my heart!”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I shall still do as my heart commands and rush to their rescue!”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Such flagrant insubordination will constitute a clear act of treason against the state.”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“As such, I will not compel any of you.”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Each of you must act according to your own convictions.”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Those who find their conscience, follow me!”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“We move out to save the civilians!”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"Approximately three hours before the order is issued to bomb Yogarasu District.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"An undisclosed location in Tenkyo.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
"Every pair of eyes in the hall is directed at a single point─",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"Natsumi, singing her heart out upon a stage bathed in dazzling lights.",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"The excitement of the crowd is at a fever pitch.",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			{
"The members of the audience stand as one and wave their arms in tune with Natsumi's song.",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"It is as though the venue is one single living being, moving with enough force to send tremors through the earth.",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			{
"Seeing her perform live fills you up with a fervor entirely different than watching her perform on television.",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"Though I'm in a private box reserved for VIPs, it still feels as though my heart is as one with the audience.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I've never seen her live before. It's crazy in here!”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“My heart still feels as though it is beating out of my chest...”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Behold! Unable to resist myself, I ended up purchasing ten whole glowsticks!”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You still have a long way to go.”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Oh, nothing...”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"My record is sixteen in one song.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			{
"But for the record, they were only foisted onto me by the folks beside me.",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Come on, snap back to reality. We're not here for fun and games, remember?”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"Today is the day of our uprising.",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"Of course, I haven't forgotten about that.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"Dispersed throughout the venue, there are over two hundred warriors in plainclothes.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"The operation is already underway.",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Has everyone been assembled?”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Of course.”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Everyone is fully equipped and ready.”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“How bold of the chairman to set the venue of her performance as our muster point.”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			{
"Considering that Elsa is likely to betray us, assembling at our headquarters was out of the question.",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			{
"After much deliberation, we arrived at the idea of using the same venue as the performance that Shino has requested.",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			{
"The Sworn Blades were able to easily blend into the crowd numbering in the thousands.",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			{
"And with Shino's permission, we were able to bring in all the equipment that we needed.",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"The only problem was securing Shino's permission.",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			{
"She's been extremely cooperative with the Sworn Blades, but at the same time, she's also Elsa's friend.",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"In the end, after much begging on Hotori's part, she finally acquiesced on the condition that we do everything in our power to spare Elsa's life.",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's nearly time.”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			{
"The final song comes to an end.",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"The crowd raises one last ovation.",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Natsumi"},
			{
"“Thanks so much for coming out today even though there was such short notice!”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Natsumi"},
			{
"“I'll keep practicing my bestest so I can sing even better the next time we see each other!”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Natsumi"},
			{
"“Let's become one again sometime soon!”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			{
"Natsumi slowly makes her way backstage, waving to the crowd with all her heart the entire time.",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"It's time to get down to business.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			{
"Fifteen minutes later─",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			{
"Chairman of the Sworn Blades, Inou Hotori, steps astride the stage.",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			{
"The gallant figure she cuts radiates a wholly different charisma compared to Kokuan-dono's dignified poise.",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			{
"The audience is filled with over two hundred warriors in full armament.",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			{
"Everyone is equipped with a bulletproof jerkin, an Artifact imbued with magicks by the priestesses of the Imperial Temple.",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			{
"Their calloused hands clutch their spellblades, smuggled beforehand into the venue.",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"Not a single person dares utter a word.",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			{
"They stand perfectly still, silently radiating fighting spirit as they look upon their Executor.",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“As you all know, I am the captain and sole survivor of the Myougi Squad.”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Ever since that day, I've always wondered why I should be the only one to survive.”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Why did I not perish on that field next to my brothers and sisters?”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“But standing before you today, I now know the answer.”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I did not survive by mere caprice.”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I was ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"made",
{"/font"},
" to survive─”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Our departed comrades would not abide my death while their regrets remained unrequitted.”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“They would not abide my death until the day comes when I might avenge theirs.”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			{
"Hotori comes to a pause.",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			{
"The same sentiments simmer in the hearts of all those gathered here today.",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			{
"─By what right am I still alive when my family and friends have all perished?",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			{
"─How dare I continue to draw breath with my country stolen away from me?",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			{
"Indeed, after the war, no small number of warriors took their own lives.",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			{
"But for those of us who still live on, the souls of the fallen, the souls of our ancestors who protected the Empire for two thousand years─",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			{
"Their souls shall not perish from our hearts.",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“The day of our reckoning has finally come.”",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“We shall deliver Her Majesty Empress Hisui from the clutches of the treacherous Okonogi Tokihiko, and we shall strike the Republic down.”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Think of the twenty thousand souls that perished in that sea of flames.”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Think of the blood of our comrades spilled by the enemy's bullets.”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Think of the unspeakable indignity suffered by the innocent Imperial people.”",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Now is the time to make them pay for everything!”",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			{
"A rousing cheer shakes the very foundations of the venue.",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			{
"The will of those alive and those who have departed coalesces into one singular fighting spirit that billows throughout the hall.",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Now, Her Majesty would address us.”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Heed well her words!”",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			{
"Kanami comes into view on the enormous screen in the center of the stage.",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			{
"Thanks to Shino's arrangements, she can speak to us directly even from within the Imperial Palace.",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			{
"At once, the cheers cease, and every single warrior stands silently at attention.",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Well met, my brave warriors.”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“It pleases me from the bottom of my heart that this day is now upon us.”",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I know well that ever since the war, you have suffered untold hardships the likes of which I could scarcely imagine, all for my sake.”",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“As your Empress, you have my deepest apologies for being powerless to protect you.”",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			{
"Kanami bows her head.",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			{
"For the Empress to lower her head to anyone is unthinkable.",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			{
"Many of the more elderly warriors are moved to tears.",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“For three long years, the people have suffered terribly at the hands of Okonogi's tyranny.”",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“There is no other means to grant the people succor save for eliminating that man.”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I am unworthy to even ask this of you, but I have the utmost faith in the strength of your fealty.”",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Please strike Okonogi down and deliver me from his clutches.”",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Then, let us establish a new government in Iseya.”",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I have bestowed my will upon Inou Hotori.”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“You may consider her will as my own. I ask that you see it done.”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I shall pray from the Imperial Palace for your good fortune.”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			{
"The image of Kanami disappears from the screen.",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			{
"Hotori turns to face the audience once more.",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Her Majesty has spoken.”",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“We are the true army of the Empire!”",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“We shall fall upon the Imperial Palace and smite the treacherous Okonogi Tokihiko.”",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Let us show Her Majesty how her proud warriors fight!”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			{
"Hotori unsheathes her blade.",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			{
"We all follow suit and draw ours.",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Move out!”",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
